  "notes": [
    "Irregular -IR verb: g→j spelling change in yo presente (*dirijo*) and throughout subjuntivo presente (*dirija, dirijas, dirija, dirijamos, dirijan*)",
    "All other tenses are fully regular",
    "Past participle: dirigido (regular)",
    "*Dirige una empresa de cien personas* = He manages a company of a hundred people",
    "*¿Me puede dirigir al museo?* = Can you direct me to the museum?",
